## Why This Is Asked

The prompt probes ability to architect cross-tenant provenance, privacy, and security in LLM ops, including policy versioning, tamper-evident logging, and leakage prevention, plus practical testing plans.

## Key Concepts

- Prompt provenance and policy versioning
- Privacy-preserving metadata (hashing, tokenization)
- Cross-tenant leakage checks in prompt chaining
- Tamper-evident, auditable logs and data locality
- Latency and rollback handling

## Code Example

